WEBVTT

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.110
Niche!

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.940
Niche!

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:40.820
Niche!

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:46.600
Underwear and Bread

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.040
Niche!

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:46.870
Niche!

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.950
Niche!

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:53.120
If you're there, come out!

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.650
Niche!

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.110
Excuse me!

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:10.020
Have you seen a little girl with 
golden hair and aqua-blue eyes?

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.410
Sorry.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:12.730
Haven't seen anyone like that.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:15.260
Anyway, would you like to see me perform?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.160
Huh?

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.050
Lag!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:22.410
Let's split up.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.480
I'll head toward the Bee Hive.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:26.590
You take Nocturne Hood.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.420
I'm sorry, but I am in a 
bit of a hurry, you see...

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:31.900
It's okay.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:34.130
You don't have to apologize with 
your head bowed like that...

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:36.360
See you again sometime!

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.670
Pardon us.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.140
Where did she go off to?

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.060
Niche...

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:52.310
So anyway, Sylvette...

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:57.780
What's with those giant 
underpants Niche took off?

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:02.800
To Niche, the underwear she was given by 
Lag are symbolic of her being his dingo.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.770
They're proof of his trust in her.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:09.180
What Niche took off wasn't 
just Lag's giant underpants...

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:14.080
That underwear was what bound them together.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.710
Underwear is their bond?

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.440
Seriously? They're bonded by underwear?

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:26.850
I know it sounds silly 
when you say it, but...

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.150
Not you too, Aria-san!

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.020
I'm sorry...

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.750
What a laugh!

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:40.650
In other words, she took them off from 
some brother-sister quarrel or lover's spat.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.670
T-This soup is...

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.550
T-Totally disgusting!

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:54.210
The one who makes Lag carry 
around this pukey soup...

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:57.090
It was <i>you</i>, Sylvette?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:57.990
Huh?

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.780
All fueled-up, thanks for the food!

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:03.550
Anyway, I'd better help look for her!

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.270
Zazie, I'll come too!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.800
Why don't we make some tea?

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:12.550
Aria-san, I want to go 
search for Niche as well!

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:19.790
If you say that you believe in Lag, you 
have to stay here and wait for him.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:26.990
It's because you are waiting here that 
this is his home, his place to return to.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:34.000
It can be difficult waiting, but this is a 
crucial role that only you can play, Sylvette.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.730
I failed at being Lag's dingo.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.200
And while I am a failure, I cannot go home.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:01.920
But I don't know what I should do.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:09.300
Steak.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.200
Niche's stomach has become hungry.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.150
Finally, the day for you 
to be eaten has come.

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:27.810
But you won't taste good 
unless you are cooked.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:34.210
We go in search of a 
place to cook you, Steak!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:50.620
I guess my performances just don't 
capture an audience's attention...

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.000
What the...

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:01.360
A fairy?

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.540
A little fairy?

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.530
Do fairies not wear underwear?

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.540
Hopping over the rooftops like that...

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.030
Ah, to be a fairy...

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.450
I must follow her example!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.780
This place smells nice.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:30.660
Stop playing with your guns and 
help me out over here, honey!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.200
We're 80% a bread shop, remember?

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:39.040
What's the point of running a weapons 
store no one shops at lately?

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.040
Honestly...

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.550
Ooh, I bet you'll cook nicely in this...

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:00.610
...all the way to the bone.

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:13.160
Steak! You will cook into a fine meal!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.790
Hey, you!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.260
You think you can steal from Sinners?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.350
That's some nerve you got!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.680
What was that?

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:35.680
The exit!

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:42.640
This here's the burglar?

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:46.540
Watch out, honey! She's 
got some strange powers.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.440
Powers?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.150
You mustn't attack humans!

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:06.600
Is it good?

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:09.880
This is the bread and weapons shop, Sinners.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:13.760
The bread my wife bakes 
is the best in Yuusari.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.400
Go ahead and eat up, little girl.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.000
I'm Niche.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.690
This is my Steak, who'll taste 
bad unless you cook him.

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.350
I-I see...

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.310
I am the owner, Jacob Gobeni.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.490
And this is my wife Sandra.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.550
Don't go makin' her mad, it ain't healthy.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:32.850
Hey!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.320
Have some soup, Niche.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.280
Is it disgusting?

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:53.540
Steak... It's a good thing you 
didn't live up to your name, huh?

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.840
Niche, my gun... How did you cut...

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:02.220
What a pretty color your hair is!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:06.190
I've never seen such beautiful 
golden hair before.

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.650
I bet you'll be one heck of 
a beauty when you grow up.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:13.060
What? You all embarrassed?

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:15.390
You might be a little one, 
but you're still a woman!

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:22.790
But why were you wandering around at 
such a late bell on an empty stomach?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.310
Niche, where are your parents?

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:28.300
I don't have any.

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.680
All I have is Lag.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.200
Lag?

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:35.480
Lag also gave me my name, Niche.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.760
So he raised you...

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:41.190
But to throw you out without 
even feeding you...

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:44.100
I was no good because 
I drank that water.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.460
And also because I couldn't beat Roda.

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:51.300
And because Lag cried even more than usual.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.630
I've lost the right to wear underpants.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:05.690
She's not wearing any.

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:12.070
I don't really understand, but 
considering how you acted before,

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.590
you must have been forced to 
do some really dangerous job.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:19.300
Niche, how about you be our kid?

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.880
Whoa there, Sandra! You drunk already?

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:27.600
You're gonna make this child go back 
to such a horrid foster parent?

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:32.210
You'll be much happier here with us, Niche.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:34.920
And you can eat as much 
of my bread as you want.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.900
Happi... er?

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:40.920
It's when your heart feels good!

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:44.340
Hey, try calling me Mama Sandra, okay?

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:45.660
Come on now!

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:48.610
What's this?

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:50.460
It's getting noisy outside.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:56.500
Tada!

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.210
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.450
Let's party!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.280
What's the matter?

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.820
Mr. Gobeni, it's him again...

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.300
It's that street performer...

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.760
Pissarro the drunk artist, huh?

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:10.500
Upsy-daisey...

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:13.050
Okay, here I go!

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.500
Watch me!

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:15.300
Whoa!

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.420
I ain't gonna lose to no fairy!

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.710
The Great Pissarro has no equal!

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:29.620
Pissarro?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:31.670
Yeah...

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:36.270
Normally, he's a coward of a man, 
always doing chintzy little acts.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:40.260
But when he gets drunk, a screw comes loose
and he starts doing these crazy dangerous stunts.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:42.960
Yahoo!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.670
Whoa...

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:45.140
How 'bout this?

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:49.090
That's dangerous!

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:51.010
You mustn't!

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.650
It's dangerous!

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.850
P-Please turn around and come back!

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:02.130
It's already way too dangerous out there!

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:04.250
I think that boy's in more trouble.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.710
He didn't have to go climbing up there...

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:09.930
A Bee? Never seen his face before.

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:11.300
Lag...

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.070
Just leave 'im be.

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:18.650
Pissarro might be gutless, 
but he has real talent.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.670
Don't do it, I said!

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:28.140
I-I'm begging you, turn back!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.060
What's with your yakking?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.610
Quiet there, boy!

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.390
Who do you think I am?

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:35.560
I don't know!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:39.680
I am the greatest street performer 
in all of Amberground!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.960
Crap, I'm falling...

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:15.020
Tie yourself to the rope, and grab on!

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:18.520
I'm so high up!

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:19.930
Oh, no!

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:22.240
Pissarro's starting to sober up!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.160
You can do it, little Bee!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.710
Come on, you guys!

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:27.840
If they fall we're gonna catch 'em!

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:28.850
Got it?

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:30.760
They can't hold out for long!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.110
Get it done, honey!

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:40.010
Sheesh... Isn't that boy a Bee?

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:43.400
What's his dingo doing when 
its master's in trouble?

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:56.060
Niche...

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:02.360
That's...

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.710
Niche!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.100
Idiot, don't let go!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.880
We're falling!

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.300
Don't worry.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:19.410
My dingo... has come for me!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:22.790
L-Little fairy?

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.380
You put on underwear?

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.060
You really had my heart pounding!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.600
Great one, Pissarro!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.010
That was an excellent performance!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:56.290
Just splendid, Pissarro!

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:00.190
Hey there...

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:01.630
Thanks...

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:03.550
Hair like swords...

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.610
I've heard stories of that.

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.670
I'm pretty sure it was of the Maka.

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:11.260
Niche must have the blood of the Maka, 
a creature out of the Northern tales.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.180
Mr. Gobeni!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.700
What happened, pops?

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.800
Oh, Lag!

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.620
There you are, Niche.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.220
Oww...

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:24.270
My skin's so scraped up, I'm bleeding.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.210
I was worried about you!

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:35.200
Let's go home, Niche.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:40.200
We can go on a delivery bright 
and early tomorrow morning.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.690
Sylvette's also worried, 
waiting for you to come home.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:46.710
Let's hurry home to our house.

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:51.780
Niche, there you go again...

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:54.350
It'll heal faster if I lick it.

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.130
Enough already, Niche...

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:59.050
It's nothing really, seriously...

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.050
What to do with those two...

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.390
I see.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.590
So, Niche is his dingo.

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:04.190
I'm fine, okay?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.980
That tickles, Niche.

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:06.600
Don't move.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.750
I said I'm fine, really.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:13.000
That tickles, Niche!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.020
Your name is Lag Seeing, right?

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:20.980
Yes.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:26.410
I see the Nocturne Op. 20 
has been passed on to you.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:32.850
Gauche Suede came to my shop for 
gun maintenance quite often.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:34.570
Gauche did?

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.760
It's not a little thing that he's 
entrusted you with this, Lag.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.280
But, it's too bad...

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:48.020
So young, for him to lose his heart...

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.640
Lag.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:55.270
Use this.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.760
A red cartridge?

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:02.180
For a shindanjuu?

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:04.050
It's a letter bullet.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:06.350
A letter... bullet?

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:13.050
With that, you can put in a much more precise 
and limited heart compared to a normal shindan.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.620
A piece of paper is packed inside.

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.960
All you need to do is write a letter on it.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.050
And don't forget to address it.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:26.750
It won't affect anybody other 
than the one it's intended for.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.880
And you only have one shot.

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:32.410
It's not for healing or an attack.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:34.560
It's a shindan for delivering.

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:40.100
You need to shoot it into someone you 
want to deliver a certain heart to.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:47.080
But, whether it resonates with 
Suede's heart depends on you.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:48.950
Do your best.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:50.360
Mr. Gobeni...

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:56.220
Our weapons are out of fashion, 
but you're welcome any time, Lag.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.750
My wife would be pleased as well.

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:10.940
Thank you!

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.940
Thank you for the meal.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:16.260
Later, pops!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.950
Niche, let's go.

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:33.460
I felt "happier" from your 
yummy bread, Mama Sandra!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.930
Well then, I'd better get going.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:47.720
Thank you, Aria-san.

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:53.830
If you went to Sinners, you should 
have picked up some bread.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.120
Zazie ate all of ours.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.940
All he left was the soup...

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:01.510
Just wait a bit, I'll 
have it heated right up!

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.030
Welcome home.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:17.230
You must be tired from your delivery...

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:41.090
Next: The Hydrangea Colored Picture-Letter
